  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="41f86f8f-baa6-571a-bac4-ada897bed3f0" activityNameId="b24af9fe-79fe-5fb8-b9c6-2d88ec4d7ea2" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wood chips, from holzpur manufacturing, softwood, burned in furnace 300kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wood chips, from holzpur manufacturing, softwood, burned in furnace 300kW
Heat of combustion of wood is based on its net calorific value. The apparent density of the chips (u=40%) is 237 kg/m3, the bulk density is 169 kg/m3 and the net calorific value is 3162 MJ/m3. All inputs and emissions are taken from ecoinvent. No transport is required since the furnace is located right next to the Walter Küng AG.;
UUID: 464a1921-be42-378f-bcea-c9f1c953ecdb
Includes the infrastructure and the wood requirements (bark chips from the Walter Küng AG), the electricity needed for the operation, the emissions to air and the disposal of the ashes. No transport is required since the furnace is located right next to the Walter Küng AG.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at the Walter Küng AG in Alpnach-Dorf (Switzerland). 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_464a1921-be42-378f-bcea-c9f1c953ecdb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
